        "content": "## 01 Email Mesh - Main Pipeline\n\nops.py run: Gmail TRX delta -> deterministic parser -> directional dedup/holds/outbox -> canonical Firebase publisher. Destination classification/correction runs only after successful delta. Financial review runs afterward; a failed delta permits notify-only, never approved publication. All original checkpoint, registry, UID/project, create-once markers and manual-category protection remain in the Python engine.\n\n**COPY ONLY — inactive by default.** Every action defaults to `preview`; explicitly select `inspect` for read-only checks. Do not cut over while the old scheduler is enabled. Live mode additionally requires `BUDGETX_N8N_ALLOW_LIVE=1` on the n8n service. Config, OAuth, Firebase Admin and financial state remain in private host files. These are n8n orchestration workflows reusing the existing Python engine, not a rewrite of ledger logic into JavaScript nodes.",
